00:01:19.888 --> 00:01:22.423
THIS IS A MENTAL HEALTH CRISIS

00:01:22.424 --> 00:01:25.059
AND THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT DOES

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:26.060
