00:02:27.889 --> 00:02:29.924
THIS IS A MENTAL HEALTH ISSUE

00:02:29.925 --> 00:02:30.991
AND PART OF HAVING THIS

00:02:30.992 --> 00:02:33.360
CONDITION MUCH LIKE IF YOU HAD

