00:02:47.075 --> 00:02:50.244
FAILED POLICIES.

00:02:50.245 --> 00:02:52.346
IT MOVES PEOPLE OUT AND INTO

00:02:52.347 --> 00:02:54.081
CARE, THEY ARE DYING ON THE

00:02:54.082 --> 00:02:55.883
